SION

This module implements an encoder/decoder for SION, a data
serialization format a little more expressive than JSON, with an
interface modeled after JSON::PP.

    use SION;
    my $data = decode_sion($sion_text);
    my $sion = encode_sion($data);

See https://dankogai.github.io/SION/ for the format itself.

Requires perl 5.22 or later (for hexadecimal floating point support).

INSTALLATION

To install this module, run the following commands:

	perl Makefile.PL
	make
	make test
	make install

SUPPORT AND DOCUMENTATION

After installing, you can find documentation for this module with the
perldoc command.

    perldoc SION

You can also look for information at:

    RT, CPAN's request tracker (report bugs here)
        https://rt.cpan.org/NoAuth/Bugs.html?Dist=SION

    Search CPAN
        https://metacpan.org/release/SION

    GitHub
        https://github.com/dankogai/p5-sion


